3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not an elementary matrix because it can't be obtained from $I$ by applying only one elementary row operation.\n\nTherefore, only $A$ and $B$ are elementary matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186437047 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a3b342f7-479f-5bb5-b000-1997f2a94c3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474840} {:answer/id #uuid "3add79aa-b544-598b-af4f-d5b4b279ff4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474841}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474841} :answer-field/id #uuid "ab74aaf1-327f-5fde-9c96-f2f46086aa4b" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475346} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c2abd6a6-7c89-54d3-b70a-a21680d42074" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474842} {:answer/id #uuid "4302a6a2-4614-5a4f-aac7-608dbad07b29" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474843}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474843} :answer-field/id #uuid "39f49585-4fc8-5935-8bc0-98192f3f79bb" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475347} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fca8b313-642a-5d70-a829-f68ae8ad852a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474844} {:answer/id #uuid "ace9e31c-296b-54d6-b129-0f6d5b96d64d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474845}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 