gned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{E}_{1}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNow, we can find the product ${E}_{1}^{-1}{E}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n{E}_{1}^{-1}{E}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186393507 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cdeabf2f-bec7-5cb3-a2f5-87d64bc530ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -16 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393509} {:answer/id #uuid "51c9df5e-7167-5286-be2d-da953833c592" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 16 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393510} {:answer/id #uuid "29c1060c-8184-5d4b-84d5-2c3efb08c5ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393511} {:answer/id #uuid "b4b7cfb6-0b62-5c35-bc0f-2ab6671c9260" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -7 & 16 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393512} {:answer/id #uuid "087018b3-d19d-59aa-a73a-f883eea2a32e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 16 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393513}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -16 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393509} :answer-field/id #uuid "17ba69ed-6398-50ed-b786-17ca04ef8511" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393508}] :question/id #uuid "156035ae-586