{bmatrix}1 & 4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-4){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe matrix ${U}^{-1}$ is given by the right-hand side of our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{U}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186383279 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c8041691-268c-5a30-acce-47ccca7f0445" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383281} {:answer/id #uuid "edfbb615-a450-5dc4-aacd-a424a91fb862" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383282} {:answer/id #uuid "4f8cd2b2-34bd-55b3-9e41-1b61002f829b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383283} {:answer/id #uuid "322543cc-7484-5646-b47f-5bdcc02b8f1d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383284} {:answer/id #uuid "613005e9-bbde-5477-b41f-7ecc34c6fb22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383285}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{A}^{-1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383283} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c3d9194-2253-57bb-9738-68e618b12cd4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383280}] :quest