\text{max}}=3:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-3I & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-3I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector $v=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.$ \n\nFinally, dividing $v$ by its norm $‖v‖=\\sqrt{5},$ we get \n\n$$\n{u}_{\\text{max}}=\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269176 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "228b048a-6de3-56b6-a3e7-0871c1de3843" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266453} {:answer/id #uuid "22995146-b5cd-5ac6-8749-c7773c7a4883" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266456} {:answer/id #uuid "722a44b6-ca00-50fc-94b1-d4f12a5f8cfd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267145} {:answer/id #uuid "a8194835-83cc-5f13-b03f-53bc498ecbc4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267666} {:answer/id #uuid "ce67314a-1abb-56f6-b237-a46f04d3d378" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267988}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267145} :answer-field/id #uuid "8681df6c-6663-5b99-800e-3e89e88d4c91" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {